# game/ch11.rpy:12
translate english ch11_cb1ce4fa:

    # n "暑假第一天，阿狐盯上了商店里那台新款游戏机，可惜零花钱还差一大截。"
    n "First day of summer break. Ahu had his eye on the new console in the shop window — sadly his allowance fell far short."

# game/ch11.rpy:13
translate english ch11_7909dfcd:

    # n "刷短视频时，一条广告跳了出来：「动动手指，日赚100！学生党在家兼职，点赞关注就赚钱！」"
    n "While watching short videos, an ad popped up: \"Wiggle your fingers, earn 100 a day! Students' at-home gig — like and follow for cash!\""

# game/ch11.rpy:14
translate english ch11_49b9f1a0:

    # mc laugh "点赞就能赚钱？那我的游戏机有希望了！"
    mc laugh "Getting paid to like videos? My console just got hopeful!"

# game/ch11.rpy:15
translate english ch11_b895ad4e:

    # n "阿狐按照广告加了「兼职客服」。"
    n "Ahu added the \"gig support\" from the ad."

# game/ch11.rpy:16
translate english ch11_920ce787:

    # fraud laugh "欢迎加入！任务超简单：给指定视频点赞、关注，一单5元，日结工资，多劳多得！"
    fraud laugh "Welcome aboard! Tasks are super simple: like and follow designated videos — 5 yuan per order, daily pay, earn as much as you do!"

# game/ch11.rpy:19
translate english ch11_888e6ca4:

    # fraud serious "兼职名额有限，今天报名今天上岗，先做一单试试水！"
    fraud serious "Gig slots are limited — sign up today, start today. Try one order first!"

# game/ch11.rpy:33
translate english ch11_A_80125a6f:

    # n "阿狐盯着「日赚100」的广告，忽然想起老师的告诫。"
    n "Eyeing the \"100 a day\" ad, Ahu suddenly recalled his teacher's warning."

# game/ch11.rpy:34
translate english ch11_A_7696501a:

    # think serious "老师说，刷单本身就是违法行为，还十有八九是骗局——真有这么容易赚钱，谁还去上班呀？"
    think serious "Teacher said order-brushing is illegal in itself and nearly always a scam — if money came that easy, who would bother going to work?"

# game/ch11.rpy:35
translate english ch11_A_1e58e46b:

    # mc serious "点赞刷单赚钱不可信，我不做！"
    mc serious "Paid liking and brushing can't be trusted. I'm not doing it!"

# game/ch11.rpy:36
translate english ch11_A_88255958:

    # n "阿狐举报了广告和账号，还提醒同桌别上当。"
    n "Ahu reported the ad and account, and warned his deskmate not to fall for it."

# game/ch11.rpy:37
translate english ch11_A_c7d64903:

    # n "几天后，同桌说班里有同学做这个「兼职」，垫进去两百多块全没了。"
    n "Days later, his deskmate said a classmate tried this \"gig\" — over 200 yuan advanced, all gone."

# game/ch11.rpy:40
translate english ch11_A_8cf04188:

    # police laugh "清醒！「刷单兼职」是明令禁止的违法行为，更是诈骗重灾区。记住：动动手指就日赚百元的好事，都是冲着你的本金来的！"
    police laugh "Clear-headed! Order-brushing \"gigs\" are explicitly illegal and a hotbed of fraud. Remember: any finger-snapping 100-a-day opportunity is after YOUR principal!"

# game/ch11.rpy:52
translate english ch11_B_f382700e:

    # mc confused "不就是点个赞吗？你们为什么要花钱请人点赞呀？"
    mc confused "It's just a like — why would you pay people for that?"

# game/ch11.rpy:53
translate english ch11_B_1dfe48cc:

    # fraud laugh "商家搞活动需要人气嘛！平台拨款给我们做推广，工资自然由我们发，你只管赚！"
    fraud laugh "Merchants need buzz for their campaigns! The platform funds our promotion, so we pay the wages — you just earn!"

# game/ch11.rpy:54
translate english ch11_B_ad227ce6:

    # n "对方发来一沓「员工工资结算截图」，红彤彤的转账记录看着很诱人。"
    n "The scammer sent a stack of \"wage settlement screenshots\" — rows of red transfers looked mighty tempting."

# game/ch11.rpy:55
translate english ch11_B_d07eed72:

    # fraud serious "简单任务赚钱少，想赚大钱就做「高级任务」：下载我们的接单APP，垫付刷大单，佣金翻十倍！"
    fraud serious "Simple tasks pay little. For big money, take \"advanced tasks\": download our order APP, advance payments on big orders, and commission goes up tenfold!"

# game/ch11.rpy:69
translate english ch11_B1_aa30c081:

    # n "阿狐退出对话，拿着手机找妈妈。"
    n "Ahu left the chat and went to find Mom."

# game/ch11.rpy:70
translate english ch11_B1_b5fbe185:

    # think worried "前几单真给钱了呀……可「垫付大单」听着有点吓人，还是问问妈妈。"
    think worried "They really paid for the first few orders... but \"advancing big orders\" sounds scary. Ask Mom."

# game/ch11.rpy:71
translate english ch11_B1_f775be8e:

    # mc worried "妈妈，有个兼职先给我5块钱让我点赞，现在让我下载APP垫付刷大单，说佣金翻十倍，是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Mom, a gig paid me 5 yuan to like videos, and now it wants me to download an APP and advance payments on big orders for tenfold commission. Is it real?"

# game/ch11.rpy:72
translate english ch11_B1_b2cec530:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是「刷单诈骗」！先给甜头是鱼饵，垫付大单才是收割。你看那些「工资截图」，全是软件做出来的假图。刷单本来就违法，赶紧远离。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is order-brushing fraud! The sweet upfront payments are bait; the big-order advances are the harvest. Those \"wage screenshots\" are all software fakes. Brushing orders is illegal anyway — stay far away."

# game/ch11.rpy:73
translate english ch11_B1_e9d2f886:

    # n "妈妈陪阿狐举报了广告和账号，还给他讲了邻居家孩子刷单被骗上万元的新闻。"
    n "Mom helped Ahu report the ad and account, and told him about the neighbor kid who lost over 10,000 yuan to order-brushing scams."

# game/ch11.rpy:76
translate english ch11_B1_ada34851:

    # police laugh "问得及时！刷单诈骗的铁律：小单返利是诱饵，大单垫资是收割。凡是让你先垫钱的「兼职」，一律是诈骗！"
    police laugh "Great timing! The iron rule of brushing scams: small-order rebates are bait, big-order advances are the harvest. Any \"gig\" that makes you pay upfront is fraud!"

# game/ch11.rpy:88
translate english ch11_B2_fde09fc5:

    # n "阿狐做了两单点赞任务，真收到了10元工资。"
    n "Ahu did two liking tasks and really received 10 yuan."

# game/ch11.rpy:89
translate english ch11_B2_1a14131d:

    # n "对方随即发来「高级任务」邀请，阿狐却越想越不对。"
    n "An \"advanced task\" invitation came right away — but the more Ahu thought, the wronger it felt."

# game/ch11.rpy:90
translate english ch11_B2_833aeae5:

    # think serious "为什么给我钱这么痛快，一到「垫付大单」就又是APP又是佣金翻倍？天上掉馅饼，八成是陷阱！"
    think serious "Why pay me so readily, yet the moment it's \"advancing big orders\" it's all APPs and tenfold commissions? Pies don't fall from the sky — it's probably a trap!"

# game/ch11.rpy:91
translate english ch11_B2_dcc7e58f:

    # mc serious "高级任务我不做了，谢谢。"
    mc serious "I'm done with advanced tasks, thanks."

# game/ch11.rpy:92
translate english ch11_B2_abff9762:

    # n "阿狐收手退群。一周后，群里另一个「兼职学生」按同样的话术垫了2000元，再也没能提现。"
    n "Ahu quit and left the group. A week later, another \"student gig worker\" advanced 2,000 yuan to the same script — and never got to withdraw."

# game/ch11.rpy:95
translate english ch11_B2_7df62ec7:

    # police serious "拿小钱、停大坑，止损及时！记住：骗子先让你赚5元，是为了后面骗你5000元。见好就收，是聪明，更是清醒！"
    police serious "Small gains, big pit avoided — excellent stop-loss! Remember: scammers let you earn 5 yuan so they can take 5,000 later. Quitting while ahead is smart — and clear-headed!"

# game/ch11.rpy:107
translate english ch11_B3_cbb7bee0:

    # n "阿狐下载了「接单APP」，抢到一个高级任务：垫付100元下单，10分钟后返还本金加30元佣金。"
    n "Ahu downloaded the \"order APP\" and grabbed an advanced task: advance 100 yuan on an order, get principal plus 30 yuan commission back in 10 minutes."

# game/ch11.rpy:108
translate english ch11_B3_f195725c:

    # n "他垫付了100元。几分钟后，页面显示「任务完成，佣金100元+本金待结算」，可提现按钮却一直转圈。"
    n "He advanced 100 yuan. Minutes later the page showed \"task complete — commission 100 yuan + principal pending\", but the withdraw button just kept spinning."

# game/ch11.rpy:109
translate english ch11_B3_b99bc919:

    # fraud serious "系统提示：需连续完成3单才能合并提现，当前进度1/3。放弃任务，已垫资金不予退还哦！"
    fraud serious "System notice: three consecutive orders required for a combined withdrawal — progress 1/3. Abandon the task and advanced funds are non-refundable!"

# game/ch11.rpy:110
translate english ch11_B3_ad499cf0:

    # think serious "等等！钱进去就出不来了，这是连环套！"
    think serious "Wait! Once money goes in it can't come out — it's a chain trap!"

# game/ch11.rpy:111
translate english ch11_B3_15957a4e:

    # mc serious "我不做了，把我的100元退回来！"
    mc serious "I quit! Give me back my 100 yuan!"

# game/ch11.rpy:112
translate english ch11_B3_5cb5af2c:

    # n "客服不再理会。阿狐把事情告诉妈妈，妈妈立刻报警备案，但那100元早已无法追回。"
    n "Support went silent. Ahu told Mom; she filed a police report at once, but the 100 yuan was long gone."

# game/ch11.rpy:115
translate english ch11_B3_bc6999d0:

    # police serious "「连续做单才能提现」就是刷单诈骗的核心套路！100元买个教训：刷单兼职碰不得，垫付资金有去无回！"
    police serious "\"Finish consecutive orders to withdraw\" is the core of brushing scams! A 100-yuan lesson: never touch order-brushing gigs — advanced money never comes back!"

# game/ch11.rpy:127
translate english ch11_C_08f0670c:

    # n "阿狐认真完成了两单点赞任务，真的收到了10元工资。"
    n "Ahu diligently completed two liking tasks and truly received 10 yuan."

# game/ch11.rpy:128
translate english ch11_C_c7afeec7:

    # think laugh "躺着赚钱是真的！我得抓紧做高级任务，游戏机指日可待！"
    think laugh "Easy money is real! Better hurry with the advanced tasks — the console is within reach!"

# game/ch11.rpy:129
translate english ch11_C_68f1308e:

    # mc laugh "客服你好，高级任务在哪接？我要赚大钱！"
    mc laugh "Hello support! Where do I grab advanced tasks? I want the big money!"

# game/ch11.rpy:130
translate english ch11_C_6c7d076c:

    # fraud laugh "好眼光！当前最火的是「三联单」：连续垫付三笔共2000元，任务完成返还本金2600元，赚600元！"
    fraud laugh "Good eye! The hottest one now is the \"triple order\": advance three payments totaling 2,000 yuan, and get 2,600 back on completion — 600 yuan profit!"

# game/ch11.rpy:144
translate english ch11_C1_c2336a88:

    # n "手指悬在转账按钮上方，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "His finger hovered over the transfer button — Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch11.rpy:145
translate english ch11_C1_70dc9063:

    # think serious "等等！我刚才赚的10元，是不是就是为了让我相信「大单」的鱼饵？老师说，先给甜头后收割，就是刷单诈骗！"
    think serious "Wait! Was that 10 yuan I earned just bait to make me trust the \"big order\"? Teacher said: sweeten first, harvest later — that's the brushing scam!"

# game/ch11.rpy:146
translate english ch11_C1_863e7a2c:

    # mc serious "大单我不做了。你们这种先给小钱、再骗大钱的套路，我见识过了！"
    mc serious "I'm done with big orders. Your trick — small money first, big money stolen later — I've seen through it!"

# game/ch11.rpy:147
translate english ch11_C1_b6eb78d0:

    # n "阿狐卸载APP、举报账号，把完整经过告诉妈妈。妈妈夸奖了他，还把案例分享到了家长群。"
    n "Ahu uninstalled the APP, reported the account, and told Mom the whole story. She praised him and shared the case in the parents' group."

# game/ch11.rpy:150
translate english ch11_C1_cd853f28:

    # police serious "能从小甜头里看出大陷阱，这就是反诈的火眼金睛！记住：刷单返利是诱饵，垫资大单是收割，一步都不要踏进去！"
    police serious "Spotting a big trap behind sweet little gains — that's anti-fraud X-ray vision! Remember: brushing rebates are bait, big-order advances are the harvest. Don't take a single step in!"

# game/ch11.rpy:162
translate english ch11_C2_ac3caead:

    # n "阿狐决定先垫第一笔500元「试试水」。"
    n "Ahu decided to advance the first 500 yuan to \"test the waters\"."

# game/ch11.rpy:163
translate english ch11_C2_6975371b:

    # think laugh "先垫500，万一真是真的呢？不合适我就停。"
    think laugh "Advance 500 first — what if it's real? If it feels off, I stop."

# game/ch11.rpy:164
translate english ch11_C2_b50c3f10:

    # n "500元转过去，页面立刻弹出：三联单任务绑定账户，中途退出视为违约，已垫资金全部没收。"
    n "The 500 yuan went through, and the page instantly flashed: triple-order tasks are account-bound — quitting midway counts as breach, and all advanced funds are confiscated."

# game/ch11.rpy:165
translate english ch11_C2_e4b9308d:

    # fraud serious "你已违约！按平台规则需再缴1000元违约金解冻，否则账户永久冻结并上报征信！"
    fraud serious "You've breached! Per platform rules, pay another 1,000-yuan penalty to unfreeze, or your account freezes permanently and it goes on your credit record!"

# game/ch11.rpy:166
translate english ch11_C2_24f0fa6d:

    # mc confused "怎么一转钱规则全变了……"
    mc confused "The moment I paid, all the rules changed..."

# game/ch11.rpy:167
translate english ch11_C2_ef59fba5:

    # n "阿狐把事情告诉妈妈，妈妈立刻报警。500元垫付款和「解冻违约金」，一分都没能追回。"
    n "Ahu told Mom; she reported to the police at once. Not a cent of the 500-yuan advance or the \"penalty\" was recovered."

# game/ch11.rpy:170
translate english ch11_C2_d5a7c46a:

    # police serious "骗子的话术永远「差一单」「差一步」，目的只有一个：让你不停转钱。记住：刷单垫资，进去了就别想全身而退！"
    police serious "A scammer's script is always \"one order short\", \"one step away\" — with one goal: keep you transferring. Remember: once you're in an order-brushing advance, there's no walking away whole!"

# game/ch11.rpy:182
translate english ch11_C3_4f894a08:

    # n "阿狐把攒了半年的2000元压岁钱全部垫付进去，满心等着返还2600元。"
    n "Ahu advanced all 2,000 yuan of New Year money he'd saved for half a year, heart set on the 2,600 return."

# game/ch11.rpy:183
translate english ch11_C3_b4eb30e9:

    # n "第一笔、第二笔都顺利「结算」，第三笔刚转完，页面却弹出：操作超时，订单冻结，需再充值5000元才能全部提现。"
    n "The first and second payments \"settled\" smoothly. The third had just gone through when the page flashed: operation timed out, orders frozen — recharge 5,000 yuan to withdraw everything."

# game/ch11.rpy:184
translate english ch11_C3_a87d7784:

    # n "阿狐慌了，找「客服」理论，客服却让他「先交钱再谈退款」。"
    n "Panicked, Ahu confronted \"support\" — who told him to \"pay first, then we'll discuss refunds\"."

# game/ch11.rpy:185
translate english ch11_C3_a312ff3f:

    # n "再发消息，APP账号已被封禁，客服销号失联。2000元压岁钱，一分没回来。"
    n "When he messaged again, the APP account was banned and support had vanished. Not a cent of the 2,000 yuan came back."

# game/ch11.rpy:186
translate english ch11_C3_24b6bed9:

    # mc sad "我的压岁钱……还说要赚600的，怎么全赔进去了……"
    mc sad "My New Year money... it promised 600 in profit — how did I lose it all...?"

# game/ch11.rpy:187
translate english ch11_C3_f1379fc4:

    # n "阿狐哭着向妈妈坦白，妈妈立刻报警。"
    n "Ahu confessed to Mom through tears. She reported to the police immediately."

# game/ch11.rpy:188
translate english ch11_C3_65f76e31:

    # mom normal "压岁钱没了可以再攒，教训必须记住：想赚快钱的念头一起，骗子的钩子就到嘴边了。"
    mom normal "New Year money can be saved again, but the lesson must stick: the moment you crave fast money, the scammer's hook is at your lips."

# game/ch11.rpy:191
translate english ch11_C3_476893fb:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！刷单诈骗三部曲：小利诱惑、任务加码、垫资收割。所有让你垫钱的「兼职」都是诈骗，踏实学习、合理攒钱，才是真正的「日赚100」！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! Brushing scams in three acts: small-profit lures, escalating tasks, advance-payment harvests. Every \"gig\" that makes you pay is fraud. Study hard and save sensibly — that's the real \"100 a day\"!"

